    {
      "section_id":"section_4",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"I sound like death (Death), I sound like life (Life)",
          "rhyme":"ajf",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"'Cause good things don't come around twice (Uh-huh)",
          "rhyme":"is",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"I sound like feathers and I sound like steel",
          "rhyme":"El",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Yeah, I sound like real",
          "rhyme":"il",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Sound like the next dude up to get a deal (That's me)",
          "rhyme":"il",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Sound hungry like I never had a meal",
          "rhyme":"il",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Sound like Heaven, sound like Hell (Hell)",
          "rhyme":"El",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"And it sound a lot better than it smell (Haha)",
          "rhyme":"El",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"And it taste a lot better than it look like (Look like)",
          "rhyme":"Ejk",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"So, I'ma make sure it cook right",
          "rhyme":"ajt",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Sound like Diddy vs. Suge Knight, sound like heat (Heat)",
          "rhyme":"at",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"Sound like the suburbs, sound like the streets (Yup)",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"Sound like a bomb, sound like boom!",
          "rhyme":"um",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Sound like a kid writin' raps in his room (Room)",
          "rhyme":"um",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"Don't sound like your everyday rap cat spittin'",
